Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:26:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD strict selected-agent slash commands so backend
 commands avoid prompt wrapping

Slash-prefixed selected-agent chat input routes through the backend command channel. Codex resumes the existing thread with the raw command stdin so commands such as /status and /fork execute as provider commands instead of conversational prompts.
